FATEC: A tool designed to assess the flexibility of participants of energy communities. It processes data and acquires weather information from external providers, and uses a causality model to compute the price elasticity of demand of consumers. The tool includes an API to execute tasks asynchronously and store results in a database.

This software is authored by:
Carlos Silva
Rafael Friães

